  "description": "The visibility\u2011sender component is configured to target the host\u202f10.0.2.15, beginning transmission on TCP port\u202f5000. It will operate with a heap comprising 64 stations and 2 polarisations, and will launch eight parallel data streams managed by four worker threads. Stream indexing will start at channel\u202f0.\n\nEach stream is limited to a maximum packet size of 1500\u202fbytes, a sustained data rate of 125.5\u202funits, and a burst capacity of 10 packets. The sender may allocate up to 20 heaps for buffering during operation.",
